    "id": "def:integrated-slope-lower-function",
    "name": "G_\\alpha",
    "construction": "For \\(\\tau\\ge0\\), define\n\\[\n G_\\alpha(\\tau)\n =2\\int_0^1[1-\\alpha-4\\sqrt{\\tau t}]_+\\,dt\n =\\begin{cases}\n 2(1-\\alpha)-\\dfrac{16}{3}\\sqrt\\tau,\n   &0\\le\\tau\\le(1-\\alpha)^2/16,\\\\[6pt]\n \\dfrac{(1-\\alpha)^3}{24\\tau},\n   &\\tau>(1-\\alpha)^2/16.\n \\end{cases}\n\\]",
